			"notes": "# Tritium 26.10-hotfix Release\n\nWe also published in [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/optitritium#download) \n\n## 1.21~1.21.8\n\n### Removed\n\nRemoved the feature that injects prompt words into the crash report (#46 #47 #48 #49 #50 By @Aether-254 ) \n\n## 1.20~1.20.1\n\n### Fix\n\nRestore vanilla-like block break particle movement by clamping collision response (#43)\n\n---\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat(create): Adds the Create module render boundary optimization fun… by @QianMo0721 in https://github.com/CraftAmethyst/Tritium/pull/29\n* 去除 AI 提示词注入/1.21 by @Aether-254 in https://github.com/CraftAmethyst/Tritium/pull/46\n\n## New Contributors\n* @QianMo0721 made their first contribution in https://github.com/CraftAmethyst/Tritium/pull/29\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CraftAmethyst/Tritium/commits/26.10-hotfix"
